  "details": "Hello Everyone\n\nThis is my concept Idea for love couples:\n\nWe could add a tag line in the menu select, or a pointing heart and next to the heart should be implemented a name/tag for someone that accepts to date with your avatar or you, for a next level relationship experience.\n\nExample, after the avatar/user tagged another avatar/user that they like each other, a linked heart appears next to their name, when people click or points to the heart, a menu appears in their select menu, with both their name tagged in it that they are in a relationship.\n\nIf a user breaks up with the other they will have to wait 24 hours before asking someone else to be with the avatar/user in love, in this part a broken heart icon appears to let others see that they just broke away from a relationship.\n\nWith that we can add a love menu with only lovers can get, they can gift chocolates, hearts, they can do a linked kiss animation if they both press the same option in the same time, and a heart animation comes out between the kiss, while we can do a linked hand holding, hug and more but it needs the animation that works for every avatar type.\n\nWith love and I hope my idea changes the Vr world chatting experience.\nGrimReaperx",
